  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>For electrolyte <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and from given curve</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>336</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>339</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>336</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>336</mn><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>336</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi>mZ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>nX</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#1